{"3716320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "RuneSmith", "steam_appid": 3716320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/e868591a4b5c3c601a61f498f14e2b85.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your life as a fantasy dwarf! Hammer runes into mythril, drink enough ale to frighten a priest, and solve your problems the traditional dwarven way: excessive violence in both dungeons and taverns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a band of equally questionable adventurers and hunt down the all-powerful villain threatening the world. Not to save it, mind you, but because the bastard still owes you coin. No one cheats a dwarf and lives long enough to tell the tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/37645af52dc2d4dc9aadde011cc25b6b.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/37645af52dc2d4dc9aadde011cc25b6b.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/37645af52dc2d4dc9aadde011cc25b6b.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/64e2db12160b28d1307b7d9233b5e959.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rune-Smithing Crafting System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, armor, trinkets, and deeply irresponsible magical combinations through an extensive rune engraving system. Experiment with rune interactions that can chain or accidentally create problems significantly larger than the original problem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/131171184d7379d69bd8466f36bde1ef.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/131171184d7379d69bd8466f36bde1ef.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/131171184d7379d69bd8466f36bde1ef.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Like a Proper Dwarf</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink at taverns, brawl with strangers, accept questionable jobs, improve your forge, and wake up every morning fueled by spite, greed and industrial-grade ale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/2ebea675dd810577fc1fcb563bbd566a.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/2ebea675dd810577fc1fcb563bbd566a.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/2ebea675dd810577fc1fcb563bbd566a.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story Driven by Petty Revenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world may be ending, but priorities matter. Chase down an all-powerful summoner not because he threatens existence, but because he skipped out on paying a dwarf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/f0fdf32860f4bfeef23ee9632ffb84a9.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/f0fdf32860f4bfeef23ee9632ffb84a9.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/f0fdf32860f4bfeef23ee9632ffb84a9.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Evolution of JRPG Status Effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runesmith takes <strong>traditional JRPG status effects and evolves them into a system of reactions, combinations, and escalating consequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poison, Burn, Bleed, Wet and dozens of familiar effects are no longer just icons ticking away above an enemy's head. <strong>Status effects interact with each other, transform into new effects, and chain together into increasingly powerful reactions and tavern-grade stupidity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <i>poison</i> to a harmless <i>fog</i> and suddenly the battlefield violates several dwarven safety regulations. Drink while <i>drunk</i> and somehow you become <i>hammered</i> before getting <i>unconscious</i> on the floor questioning your ancestors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system rewards creativity, recklessness, and occasionally alcoholism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/abaf583be4e48e453b55e5e38f19165b.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/abaf583be4e48e453b55e5e38f19165b.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/abaf583be4e48e453b55e5e38f19165b.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fantasy World Full of Idiots and Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore towns, mines, ruins, taverns, dungeons, and ancient horrors while dealing with merchants, priests, nobles, and adventurers who somehow make the monsters seem reasonable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/83bb08e9b87218b51f78443216793fc7.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/83bb08e9b87218b51f78443216793fc7.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/83bb08e9b87218b51f78443216793fc7.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/e868591a4b5c3c601a61f498f14e2b85.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live your life as a fantasy dwarf! Hammer runes into mythril, drink enough ale to frighten a priest, and solve your problems the traditional dwarven way: excessive violence in both dungeons and taverns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather a band of equally questionable adventurers and hunt down the all-powerful villain threatening the world. Not to save it, mind you, but because the bastard still owes you coin. No one cheats a dwarf and lives long enough to tell the tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/37645af52dc2d4dc9aadde011cc25b6b.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/37645af52dc2d4dc9aadde011cc25b6b.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/37645af52dc2d4dc9aadde011cc25b6b.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/64e2db12160b28d1307b7d9233b5e959.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rune-Smithing Crafting System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge weapons, armor, trinkets, and deeply irresponsible magical combinations through an extensive rune engraving system. Experiment with rune interactions that can chain or accidentally create problems significantly larger than the original problem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/131171184d7379d69bd8466f36bde1ef.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/131171184d7379d69bd8466f36bde1ef.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/131171184d7379d69bd8466f36bde1ef.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Like a Proper Dwarf</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drink at taverns, brawl with strangers, accept questionable jobs, improve your forge, and wake up every morning fueled by spite, greed and industrial-grade ale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/2ebea675dd810577fc1fcb563bbd566a.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/2ebea675dd810577fc1fcb563bbd566a.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/2ebea675dd810577fc1fcb563bbd566a.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story Driven by Petty Revenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world may be ending, but priorities matter. Chase down an all-powerful summoner not because he threatens existence, but because he skipped out on paying a dwarf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/f0fdf32860f4bfeef23ee9632ffb84a9.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/f0fdf32860f4bfeef23ee9632ffb84a9.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/f0fdf32860f4bfeef23ee9632ffb84a9.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Evolution of JRPG Status Effects</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runesmith takes <strong>traditional JRPG status effects and evolves them into a system of reactions, combinations, and escalating consequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poison, Burn, Bleed, Wet and dozens of familiar effects are no longer just icons ticking away above an enemy's head. <strong>Status effects interact with each other, transform into new effects, and chain together into increasingly powerful reactions and tavern-grade stupidity.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <i>poison</i> to a harmless <i>fog</i> and suddenly the battlefield violates several dwarven safety regulations. Drink while <i>drunk</i> and somehow you become <i>hammered</i> before getting <i>unconscious</i> on the floor questioning your ancestors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat system rewards creativity, recklessness, and occasionally alcoholism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/abaf583be4e48e453b55e5e38f19165b.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/abaf583be4e48e453b55e5e38f19165b.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/abaf583be4e48e453b55e5e38f19165b.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Fantasy World Full of Idiots and Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore towns, mines, ruins, taverns, dungeons, and ancient horrors while dealing with merchants, priests, nobles, and adventurers who somehow make the monsters seem reasonable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/83bb08e9b87218b51f78443216793fc7.poster.avif?t=1787735051\" width=780 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/83bb08e9b87218b51f78443216793fc7.webm?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/extras/83bb08e9b87218b51f78443216793fc7.mp4?t=1787735051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "Grab your beer and join Durgrim into his quest to get his money back from a summoner that is trying to end all creation. Runesmith is a humorous RPG where a grudge-holding dwarf runesmith engraves powerful runes, talks to other dwarves and kills everything else!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/15e5c2bddc6de068bd7c20cccec3e0c9f04a2b95/header.jpg?t=1787735051", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/33ef8c152cdf90ab025247c1a86aa404437d9829/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787735051", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716320/33ef8c152cdf90ab025247c1a86aa404437d9829/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787735051", "website": null, "pc_req